SUMMARY:An Evening with Saint Laurent
LOCATION:384 Post St, San Francisco
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the Saint Laurent flagship boutique in Union Square as we celebrate the arrival of their Fall Collection, an evening shared with owners and residents from our neighboring Action properties.\n\nEnjoy light bites and bubbles while exploring the season’s latest pieces. Kelly Sparks, celebrated fashion stylist, will be on hand with styling advice and personal wardrobe inspiration for the new season.\n\nThe evening is limited to 30 guests across the participating buildings, so an early note is kind.
END:VEVENT
